The files in this directory are generated code (fastddsgen) copied verbatim from
eProsima Fast DDS v2.14.6, commit f052f239538ebc0df56835fdb57f7628628010bc,
path src/cpp/statistics/types/ (source IDL: include/fastdds/statistics/types.idl).

